      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i've been on zoloft for like 2 years for my depression and its working fine but i messed up my back lifting something yesterday and the pain is killing me. i was thinking about taking some tramadol i have left over from a surgery a while ago to help with the ache... is it cool to take those together?",
