    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i totally get it but my doctor is actually super hard to reach and i'm in like a ton of pain right now. is it really that dangerous? i've taken them both separately before and was fine, so i feel like just taking a low dose of the tramadol wouldn't really be an issue, right?",
